OL,3,GNEWSAWestminster council cuts 520 jobs
OL,4,Ain savings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 500 staff will be made
OL,7,Fredundant at Westminster City Council
OL,8,Fas the authority aims to become
OL,9,F"leaner" and save #29m in the coming
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe authority said 520 of its 3,720
OL,13,Fstaff posts would be cut, with the
OL,14,Fhighest proportion coming from
OL,15,Fmanagerial bands and senior roles.
OL,17,FIn July the council estimated it faced
OL,18,Fa #160m budget gap by 2029 due to
OL,19,Fchanges in government funding, risings
OL,20,Fcosts, demand for services and
OL,21,Finflation.b@/
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
