OL,3,GNEWSAWestminster council cuts 520 jobs
OL,4,Ain savings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Fisher, the council's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for value for money and finance,
OL,8,Fsaid the job cuts were a "difficult"
OL,9,Fannouncement, but the council hoped the
OL,10,Fdecision would pay dividends in the
OL,11,Fyears ahead.
